---
// トップページと同様のレイアウトコンポーネントをインポート
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayoutEn.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Privacy Policy — AI Chat Memo',
  description: 'Privacy Policy for the AI Chat Memo Chrome Extension',
};

const lastUpdated = "September 6, 2026";
const contactEmail = "your-email@example.com"; // ★ご自身の連絡先メールアドレスに変更してください
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <main class="py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    
    {/* ヘッダー部分 */}
    <header class="border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-8 mb-10">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-mono mb-4">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-primary dark:text-teal-400 font-medium">
        Last updated: {lastUpdated}
      </p>
    </header>

    {/* 本文エリア */}
    <div class="space-y-10 text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-300">
      
      <section>
        <p>
          <strong>AI Chat Memo</strong> ("we", "our", or "the Extension") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how our Chrome extension collects, uses, and safeguards your information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">1. Information Collection and Storage</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          AI Chat Memo is designed with a privacy-first, serverless architecture. <strong>We do not operate any external backends, nor do we collect, track, or store your personal data or chat content on any remote servers managed by us.</strong>
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Local Storage:</strong> Temporary states and application settings are stored locally within your web browser.</li>
          <li><strong>Google Drive / Sheets:</strong> Your chat memos and project metadata are saved <em>directly</em> to a Google Spreadsheet automatically created within your own Google Drive account.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">2. Use of Google OAuth 2.0 & Permissions</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          To provide its core functionality, the Extension requests access to specific Google Services via OAuth 2.0. The only sensitive scope we request is:
        </p>
        <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/50 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800">
          <code class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold block mb-2">https://www.googleapis.com/auth/drive.file</code>
          <p class="text-sm">
            This scope is strictly limited to viewing and managing <strong>only the specific Google Drive files</strong> created by or opened with this Extension (specifically, the "AI Chat Memo" spreadsheet). The Extension <strong>cannot</strong> read, access, modify, or delete any other files in your Google Drive.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* 審査に必須なハイライトセクション */}
      <section class="bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-900/20 border-l-4 border-emerald-500 p-6 rounded-r-xl shadow-sm my-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-emerald-500">🛡️</span> Google API Services User Data Policy Disclosure
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm">
          AI Chat Memo's use and transfer to any other app of information received from Google APIs will adhere to the 
          <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 underline hover:no-underline font-medium">
            Google API Services User Data Policy
          </a>, including the <strong>Limited Use</strong> requirements.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">3. Data Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
        <p>
          Since all communications occur directly between your web browser and Google API endpoints (direct Google Sheets API v4 integration), no third parties (including us) have access to your data. We do not sell, trade, rent, or transfer your data to external entities under any circumstances.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">4. Data Retention and Deletion</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          All stored data resides exclusively in your personal Google Drive and local browser storage. You maintain full control over your data at all times:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>You can edit or delete individual notes directly through the Extension or via your Google Spreadsheet.</li>
          <li>Deleting the "AI Chat Memo" spreadsheet from your Google Drive will permanently remove all associated remote data.</li>
          <li>Uninstalling the Extension will clear all locally cached extension data.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">5. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or the practices of AI Chat Memo, please contact us at:
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/50 border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800">
          <span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-slate-400">Email:</span>
          <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`} class="text-primary dark:text-teal-400 hover:underline font-medium">
            {contactEmail}
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>